2026-07-23T17:11:22.4038012Z     The ``pytest`` framework makes it easy to write small tests, yet
2026-07-23T17:11:22.4038190Z     scales to support complex functional testing for applications and libraries.
2026-07-23T17:11:22.4038319Z     
2026-07-23T17:11:22.4038413Z     An example of a simple test:
2026-07-23T17:11:22.4038488Z     
